data sources : ViewModel binds the four web reads via stateMachineDebuggerPageSourceOf() — shared S8 VehiclesStore
               (vehicles + per-vehicle state), shared S8 FsmStore (stats + transitions), the app-scoped
               SelectedVehicleStore (picker), and ApiHttpClient.safeRequest for the snapshot inspector. uiState folds
               vehicles+state+stats+transitions into one UiState<DebuggerData>; snapshotState is the selected-transition
               signal feed. No HTTP in the view.
si/units     : the FSM feeds are non-unit-bearing (state names, triggers, counts, RFC-3339 instants), so there is no SI
               conversion at the boundary; the one typed read (/vehicles/{id}/state) stays SI end to end and only its
               state/since/charging/speed fields feed the live-state hero. No new non-SI fields introduced.
a11y/theme   : MaterialTheme tokens only (no hardcoded color/typography); panel paneTitle + Icon contentDescriptions +
               ChartContainer accessibleDescription + IconButton 48dp targets; dark/dynamic theme honored via the
               shared components.
